Stores are stored sequence lists, in below example mySeq is a store.

{common:table}
{common:demo}{sequence:range '20..30', push='mySeq'/} {/common:demo}
{common:demo}{sequence:auto mySeq} {$sequence} {/sequence:auto}{/common:demo}
{common:demo}{pull:mySeq} {$sequence} {/pull:mySeq}{/common:demo}
{/common:table}
